#: model:ir.model.fields,help:hr_rfid_andromeda_import.field_hr_rfid_andromeda_import_wiz__default_import_as
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:hr_rfid_andromeda_import.field_hr_rfid_andromeda_welcome_wiz__default_import_as
msgid ""
"Where Andromeda users land in Odoo by default — hr.employee for staff, res."
